[Music]  and tonight from sunday to monday it was  that time of the year again the golden  globe winners were honored for the 79th  time a special novelty this year was the  digital awards ceremony without any  glitch and glamour instead the winners  were announced quite unspectacularly via  social media in addition to the  individual winners the unofficial  ranking among the numerous streaming  services is particularly interesting  after all netflix has been while the  biggest winner in recent years this year  however netflix was beaten out by hbo  which won the most trophies with a total  of six on the acting side will smith and  king richard and nicole kidman being the  ricardo's won best actor and best  actress in motion picture drama  respectively the most prestigious golden  globe for the best motion picture drama  was won by the novel adaption the power  of the dog squid game actor oyunxu also  won an award in the best supporting  actor category on the musical level the  jury was convinced on the one hand by  han zimmer's compositions for dune as  the best movie score and on the other  hand the duo of billy ellis and finney  zicotta was awarded for the best movie  song they were responsible for the new  bond track the golden globes are often  considered a precursor to the oscars  globe winners have a good chance of  winning another trophy we are all the  more eagerly awaiting the academy awards  which will be held on march 27  2022 on friday last week the disney plus  twitter channel published that the  upcoming pixar movie turning red will be  released on the streaming service only  and not in theaters the reason is likely  to be the ongoing pandemic which makes  it difficult for vera young viewers in  particular to watch the film in movie  theaters upon release due to possible  restrictions the plot revolves around 13  year old girl melee who at first glance  was nothing more than a normal teenager  she hides her feeling for a crush is a  fan of a rising boy band and of course  wants to come across as being cool at  all costs everyone knows the problem of  turning red at awkward moments but melee  has hit it much harder every time other  people would get red cheeks she  transforms into a giant red panda it's a  pretty tough faith that she has to learn  to deal with behind the scenes there is  quite a bit of trouble as a lot of pixar  staff members aren't too fond of  disney's move to skip theaters various  team members who of course wish to  remain anonymous are expressing their  displeasure and disappointment as they  had all hoped that turning red would be  the great comeback to the big screen on  the other hand they also show  understanding after all when it comes to  some matters tough decisions have to be  made their next hope would be the pixar  film light year which is due in june  this year turning red however will be  released on march 11 2022 already  the batman fans won't have to wait much  longer for its theatrical release it is  therefore all the more pleasing that we  are regularly receiving new images from  warner brothers during the important  promotional phase in the last few days  some new pics have appeared on which not  only two well-known villains but also  the dark knight himself can be seen  first let's take a look at the bad guys  ign shared a snapshot of the riddler and  the penguin last sunday the shot of the  riddler in particular caused some buzz  in the movie community after all so far  you have barely been able to make other  batman antagonists in the teasers and  trailers however it is not only the fact  that you can finally see the riddler in  all its glory but especially the way in  which the riddler is presented that has  caused some confusion on the picture he  looks clearly different from the role of  jim carrey in batman forever for example  the situation is similar with the  penguin we already know him from all the  batman movies in particular danny  devito's weird version from batman  returns comes to mind colin farrell's  portrayal actually looks more like a mob  boss from a martin sco [ __ ] film so all  in all we can say that both villains  look much more realistic and less like  an adaptation from the comics well  that's a good or bad thing will only be  seen upon release anyway two more  pictures appeared via usa today on one  of them we see robert pattinson in a  gloomy scene the second much more  exciting picture on the other hand shows  batman and catwoman in front of a  picturesque skyscraper setting as we've  known since late last year from a  synopsis by cinemax in the batman bruce  wayne and selena cow are childhood  friends which of course should provide  some emotional tension between the two  if you still haven't had enough of the  images you can look forward to more  snapshots directly from warner where you  can see all the characters mentioned  again from a different perspective as  well as a few beyond the scene shots in  summary these are some great pictures  that whet your appetite for the  blockbuster the batman is scheduled for  release on march 4th 2022  last winter amazon started production on  the third season of the boys now it is  finally known when a season start can be  expected to the joy of many fans the  waiting time is kept short because the  season will be available on amazon prime  video as early as june 3rd 2022  fittingly the first teaser was released  which is expectedly short but definitely  makes you eager for more you can see  anthony stars homelander and aaron  moriarty starlight obviously in the  headquarters of the 7 where especially  homelander is in the flurry of camera  flashes of the reporters the longer the  scene goes on the more confused and  serious he looks and it is quite likely  that the focus on the upcoming season  could clearly be on homelander in  addition to him and starlight the other  main characters will also be returning  to the screen including call urban ass  butcher jack quaid as huey and dominique  mceligad as queen meth together they  will once again bring plenty of action  center and black humor to the series  while they will also be joined by some  newcomers for instance we will get to  see supernatural story jansen eccles as  soldier boy and the walking dead star  actress laurie holden as crimson  countess they are members of another  super team called payback children eric  kripke is in charge of production while  the infamous duo of seth rogen and evan  goldberg will also keep an eye on the  same thing the first three episodes of  the third season of the boys will be  released on june 3rd after which a new  episode will be released every week  most people are familiar with the final  destination movie series especially in  the 2000s the brutal and sometimes  somewhat trashy films enjoy great  popularity the fifth and last part was  released in 2011 more than 10 years ago  now the ball seems to be set rolling for  a new installment as the hollywood  reporter reveals that no way home  director john watts is taking over  production of the upcoming blockbuster  as we have known since the beginning of  2021 another final destination party has  been in the planning for quite some time  and now it is also become known that it  will not be released in theaters but  exclusively on hbo max the previous  plans of screenwriters patrick melton  and marcus dunsman have been completely  scrapped and instead watts came up with  his own idea which will be implemented  by new writers laurie evans taylor and  guy busick instead of being a true  sequel this will be more of a reboot no  further information has leaked out yet  but we are excited for a new final  destination movie after many years  so far there are two movies in the  indonesian action series the raid the  last one was released in 2014 again  directed by gareth evans fans have been  waiting for the announced remake for  quite some time now and as deadline  reports it is gradually moving forward  streaming giant netflix recently  acquired the rights to the raid and  announced a few new additions in the  process evans is no longer in toxic  director after the two original parts  instead the expandables 3 director  patrick hughes is now to direct the  remake and simultaneously write the  script with james beaufort behind the  scenes action legend michael bay is also  involved as a producer which is quite  fitting for a film like the raid he is  joined by aforementioned gareth evans  who will also be keeping an eye on the  production the original is set in  indonesia where police officer has to  brutally make his way through a  high-rise full of criminals  while the storyline was rather subtle it  featured brilliantly choreographed  martial arts scenes and very bloody  confrontations the planned remake is  supposed to keep the spirit of the  original but the location of the action  will be moved to philadelphia and the  usa where undercover agents of the de  have to fight their way through a house  full of members of a drug cartel we are  definitely excited and looking forward  to the raid remake although it is not  yet known when the film will be released  on netflix  for those of you who haven't seen it yet  this week we recommend our original for  avatar 2. in only 11 minutes you will be  up to date with the latest news on this  sequel also for fans of apocalyptic  action films the third trailer for this  sci-fi movie moonfall is definitely a  must-see  [Music]

